## Summary flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[CreateMemo / UpdateMemo content path] --> B[RebuildMemoPayload]
  B --> C[MarkdownService.ExtractAll]
  C --> D[goldmark AST walk]
  D --> E["Payload.Tags + Payload.Property"]
  E --> F[Store CreateMemo / UpdateMemo]
  G["CreateMemo: optional request.Location"] --> H["Payload.Location user-set"]
  H --> F
  I[memopayload.RunOnce] -.->|"defined, never wired in server.go"| B
  J[s3presign.RunOnce] --> K[S3 presign only - active]
```

**Recomputation triggers in production:** memo create (including comments via `CreateMemoComment` → `CreateMemo`), and memo update when the update mask includes `"content"`. The batch `memopayload.RunOnce` runner would rebuild all memos but is **unused** in the current server startup path.
